Subject: [PATCH 8/15] drm/sun4i: tcon: Add channel debug
Date: Tue,  7 Mar 2017 09:56:27 +0100
Message-Id: <71ebb24fd6b0efc1af7de732aa4aac9d5a2ee4f1.1488876832.git-series.maxime.ripard@free-electrons.com>
